.TH PCRE2_GET_MATCH_DATA_HEAPFRAMES_SIZE 3 "18 January 2023" "PCRE2 10.49-DEV"
.SH NAME
pcre2_get_match_data_heapframes_size - get the size of match data heapframes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.sp
.B #include <pcre2.h>
.PP
.nf
.B PCRE2_SIZE pcre2_get_match_data_heapframes_size(
.B "      pcre2_match_data *\fImatch_data\fP);"
.fi
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.sp
This function returns the size, in bytes, of the heapframes data block that is
owned by its argument.
.P
There is a complete description of the PCRE2 native API in the
.\" HREF
\fBpcre2api\fP
.\"
page and a description of the POSIX API in the
.\" HREF
\fBpcre2posix\fP
.\"
page.
